      "content": "hey, i'm working on a pitch for a new gritty crime series set in a major metro area. we want it to feel super authentic and hard-hitting, not some sanitized cop show. can you help me brainstorm some character archetypes for the detectives and the local criminal elements? i want the cast to feel like a real, diverse slice of the city so the tension feels earned.",
